###### Example bucket policy enforcing TLS 1.3 using the S3:TlsVersion condition key

{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "DenyInsecureConnections",
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "Principal": "*",
